			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize Cocoon build artifacts and RouteManifest\n\nUpdate the `Element` submodule to the latest revision `e5d00f5d`, specifically targeting the `Cocoon` component. Regenerate all TypeScript compilation outputs in the `Target/` directory and refresh the `RouteManifest` timestamp to align the extension host sidecar with the most recent source modifications.\n\nThis ensures that generated JavaScript bundles, source maps, and gRPC service definitions are fully synchronized, maintaining a consistent state for the upcoming testing phase of the extension host pipeline.",
