				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				126,
				11
			],
			"Message": "docs(Project): Create master documentation index and standardize Element links\n\nIntroduce `Documentation/GitHub/README.md` as the central navigation hub for all Land architecture, build, workflow, and per-element documentation. The new index catalogs every technical reference with line counts and topic summaries, establishing a unified entry point for the distributed documentation ecosystem.\n\nCorrect cross-repository links in `Workflow/ApplicationStartupAndHandshake.md` and `Workflow/TierGatedImplementationSelection.md` to point to component-specific GitHub repositories (e.g., `CodeEditorLand/Mountain`, `CodeEditorLand/Cocoon`) instead of the monolithic `Land` repository. Align formatting in `Workflow/TierGatedImplementationSelection.md` tables for consistent column widths.\n\nSynchronize the `Element` submodule to integrate these standardized documentation updates and critical runtime patches. The submodule update resolves webview rendering failures by injecting CSS font fallbacks in `Output` and forwarding webview options in `Cocoon`, while standardizing whitespace characters in `Architecture.md` files across all 14 core elements to ensure visual consistency.\n\nThese changes ensure the technical reference accurately reflects the decentralized repository structure and resolves extension compatibility issues in the Tauri webview runtime.",
			"SHA": "0054afb8d2bb548e962b004d3daa66c8fdd5b61a"
		},
